            <ArticleTitle>[Acute myocardial infarction--multivessel coronary artery disease in a 37-year-old postpartum women].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1381-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Acute myocardial infarction (MI) in the postpartum period is rare. We present a case of a 37-year-old women with acute MI which occurred 15 days after delivery. Coronary angiography revealed multivessel coronary artery disease and she underwent successful surgical revascularisation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
